olicy →  ValidationPolicy&lt;br&gt;AdjustmentAction  — recommendedByRule →  Rule  [F obsoleta]&lt;br&gt;AdjustmentAction  — adjustsProperty →  ObservableProperty  [F]&lt;br&gt;KnowledgeProfile  — assertsKnowledge →  KnowledgeEntity&lt;br&gt;∅dom  — generatedBy →  Agent&lt;br&gt;∅dom  — hasValidationStatus →  ValidationStatus  [F]&lt;br&gt;∅dom  — hasEvidence →  Thing&lt;br&gt;Diagnosis  — isDiagnosisOf →  SensoryDefect ⊔ TechnicalDeviation ⊔ ObservedDifference&lt;br&gt;ExplanationAssertion  — explains →  Diagnosis ⊔ ObservedDifference  [F]&lt;br&gt;∅dom  — generatedByRule →  Rule  [obsoleta]&lt;br&gt;ObservedDifference  — comparesExtraction →  EspressoExtraction&lt;br&gt;RecommendedAction  — recommendedDirection →  AdjustmentDirection  [F]&lt;br&gt;AdjustmentOutcomeAssessment  — assessesAdjustment →  ParameterAdjustment  [F]&lt;br&gt;AdjustmentOutcomeAssessment  — hasOutcomeCategory →  AdjustmentOutcomeCategory  [F]&lt;br&gt;TechnicalConformanceAssessment  — assessesExtraction →  EspressoExtraction  [F]&lt;br&gt;TechnicalConformanceAssessment  — againstProfile →  ExtractionProfile  [F]&lt;br&gt;TechnicalConformanceAssessment  — hasTechnicalConformance →  TechnicalConformanceCategory  [F]" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#F97316;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=16;fontColor=#334155;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2444.0" y="2915" width="2312.0" height="844" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="52" value="&lt;b&gt;Contexto, café y sensorial&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;ProcessEntity  — occurredUnder →  EnvironmentalCondition&lt;br&gt;SensoryEvaluation ⊔ SensoryProfile  — hasSensoryDescriptor →  SensoryDescriptor&lt;br&gt;SensoryEvaluation  — hasPerceivedDefect →  SensoryDefect&lt;br&gt;SensoryEvaluation  — hasMainTaste →  BasicTaste&lt;br&gt;SensoryEvaluation  — hasMouthfeelTexture →  MouthfeelTexture&lt;br&gt;SensoryEvaluation  — hasDesiredSensoryChange →  DesiredSensoryChange&lt;br&g